---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import GuideTable from '../../components/GuideTable.astro';

const dreo = 'https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6FCKQML?tag=dailyvirald06-20';
const throwUrl = 'https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZR6YBHK?tag=dailyvirald06-20';
const rows = [
    {
        name: 'Dreo heater, Gold HSH006',
        href: dreo,
        goodWhen: 'One bedroom or small office feels cold, and the rest of the house is fine.',
        limit: 'The claim is about 200 square feet. It does not turn side to side, and it needs a wall outlet.',
    },
    {
        name: 'Bedsure heated throw',
        href: throwUrl,
        goodWhen: 'You want heat on your lap or shoulders, not in the air.',
        limit: 'It is 50 by 60 inches, so it covers a person, not a room.',
    },
];
---

<Base
    title="Best space heater for one room under $50"
    description="A corded Dreo heater for one bedroom, compared with a heated throw if you only need warmth on you. Prices move."
>
    <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/guides/">Guides</a> / <span aria-current="page">One-room heater</span>
    </nav>
    <h1>Best space heater for one room under $50</h1>
    <p>The bedroom stays cold, but heating every room feels wasteful. You want the air in one space warmer, and you want today's price to still make sense as a modest gift.</p>
    <p><strong>Our pick:</strong> the Dreo Gold HSH006, if the room is about one bedroom. It is a corded 1500W ceramic tower. The claim is about 200 square feet. It does not turn from side to side, so you point it, then use the remote.</p>
    <p class="notice">Price at the time of writing. Check Amazon for today's price. "Under $50" only counts if Amazon still shows that.</p>
    <p class="notice">As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
    <p>
        <a class="cta-amazon" href={dreo} rel="sponsored nofollow">See today's price for the Dreo heater</a>
    </p>
    <GuideTable rows={rows} />
    <h2>Why the throw is the other choice</h2>
    <p>
        The <a href="/reviews/bedsure-heated-blanket-throw-review-b0bzr6ybhk/">Bedsure heated throw</a> has six heat levels and an 8-hour shutoff. It warms a person. It does not warm the room. Read the
        <a href="/reviews/dreo-space-heater-review-gift-ideas-under-50-b0c6fckqml/">Dreo review</a> if you need the safety lines, including no extension cord.
    </p>
</Base>

<style>
    .crumb { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .crumb a { color: var(--muted); }
    .cta-amazon {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--amazon);
        color: var(--amazon-ink);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        margin: 8px 0 18px;
    }
</style>
